### 1. Exchange Bootstrap Control Token for Session
# @name sessionExchange
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/control/v1/session/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{bootstrapToken}}"
}

###

### 2. Rotate / Disclose Native API Bearer Token
# @name rotateNativeToken
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/control/v1/credentials/native/rotate
X-Control-Session: {{sessionToken}}
X-PaySim-CSRF: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 3. Create an Order in INR
# @name createOrder
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "receipt": "rcpt_dev_1001",
  "notes": {
    "customer": "Jane Doe",
    "purpose": "Local Gateway Testing"
  }
}

###

### 3. Retrieve the Created Order
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}

###

### 4. List All Orders
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/v1/orders?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{nativeToken}}
